    <item>
      <title>Pharos v1.0.0</title>
      <link>https://github.com/domus-apps/pharos/releases/tag/v1.0.0</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 12:45:48 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li>Initial release: keep your Mac awake from the menu bar — left-click the beacon to toggle, right-click for timed presets (from 15 minutes to 8 hours) with a live countdown.</li>
<li>Optionally keep the display awake too (on by default — a dark, locked screen is indistinguishable from a sleeping Mac), toggleable while active.</li>
<li>Choose the menu bar icon style (beacon, sun, eye, or coffee cup), hide the icon entirely, start keeping the Mac awake at launch, and launch at login.</li>
<li>Sparkle keeps the app up to date.</li>
</ul>      ]]></description>
